    "updated_at": "2018-10-03T19:25:26Z",
    "body": "Here it is in Blink, Gecko and WebKit:\r\n* https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/storage/storage_event.idl?l=38&rcl=59048c8cc3894851410543095756e0e74ffe1cc5\r\n* https://github.com/mozilla/gecko-dev/blob/679b5e2db1bc607cff5ad8640eb9a4b3626e4cf9/dom/webidl/StorageEvent.webidl#L23\r\n* https://github.com/WebKit/webkit/blob/8da57840865d2f45ef5e27c8db2ee7d6b8f5e3ce/Source/WebCore/storage/StorageEvent.idl#L36\r\n\r\nI'd suggest this definition:\r\n```webidl\r\nvoid initStorageEvent(DOMString type,\r\n  optional boolean bubbles = false,\r\n  optional boolean cancelable = false,\r\n  optional DOMString? key = null,\r\n  optional DOMString? oldValue = null,\r\n  optional DOMString? newValue = null,\r\n  optional USVString url = \"\",\r\n  optional Storage? storageArea = null);\r\n```",
